1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,732
Once you have a funnel, it works for you every hour.

2
00:00:02,782 --> 00:00:04,938
Here's where to see what it found.

3
00:00:05,397 --> 00:00:09,174
Above the crypto table, switch My Watchlist to Dynamic funnel.

4
00:00:09,224 --> 00:00:11,508
Each of your funnels is one row.

5
00:00:19,264 --> 00:00:23,767
The chips count the assets holding each stage, then Flagged and Candidates.

6
00:00:23,817 --> 00:00:26,015
Click a chip to show those assets.

7
00:00:26,467 --> 00:00:30,692
The table lists them, largest first, with the stage each one has reached.

8
00:00:37,627 --> 00:00:42,108
On the row: pause or resume the funnel, start it again, or open it to edit.

9
00:00:42,568 --> 00:00:46,857
It also shows in Quick Snapshot, with what changed since you last looked.

10
00:00:51,763 --> 00:00:55,476
Switch back to My Watchlist any time. Your choice is saved.
